{"title":"Enoki Mushroom","slug":"Enoki_Mushroom","hero":{"file":"Снимок_экрана_2025-02-21_115244-no-bg-preview_(carve.photos).webp","width":181,"height":202},"pageid":3647,"revid":20975,"timestamp":"2026-01-02T19:13:32Z","lastEditor":"Jojough","categories":["Fruits"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Snowlands"},{"label":"Shop","value":"N/A"},{"label":"Price","value":"$125 raw $500 dye jar"},{"label":"Function","value":"Sellable Fruit"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"Version 1.71.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2>\n<p>The <b>Enoki Mushroom</b> can be found in the same cave as <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sapphire/\">Sapphire</a> in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowlands/\">Snowlands</a>. It sells for $125 raw and $500 in a dye jar. There is also a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Golden_Enoki_Mushroom/\">golden</a> version just like <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Apple/\">apples</a>.\n</p>"}
